# `dotnet.debug` when the build fails: the task pane shows the
# compiler's line, the toast says no debugger is launched, and no
# session exists. `MNML_SHIM_DOTNET_FAIL` makes the shim's `build` exit 1.
# env: PATH=${MNML_SHIMS}:${PATH}
# env: MNML_SHIM_DOTNET_FAIL=1
write App.csproj "<Project Sdk=\"Microsoft.NET.Sdk\" />\n"
write Program.cs "Console.WriteLine(\"hi\")\n"
open Program.cs
command dotnet.debug
expect screen contains "error CS1002"
expect screen contains "dotnet build failed — not launching the debugger"
expect screen lacks "dap: spawned"
